    "body": "Since a short-id collision can happen between in-mempool and extratxn pairs of unique txns, the reported extra txn count can underflow. This reported value is only used for logging purposes, but we should avoid this anyways.\r\n\r\nNote that the unit test cooked up is maybe too cute.",
